[Audio:flame-sound:Flame Sound]
Played by #R$BECC.
Sixteen cycles of a tone, one pitch for each entry of the table at #R$BEDE.
The game plays just one of them each time, chosen by #R$9693, so here all
sixteen are played one after the other.

#AUDIO0(flame-sound.wav)(#INCLUDE(FlameSound))

[Audio:explosion:Explosion]
Played by #R$BEEE.
Sixteen short tones, with pitches taken from the ROM.

#AUDIO0(explosion.wav)(#INCLUDE(Explosion))

Note, this uses #R$9693 and #R$9695 and so isn't the same twice.

[Audio:appearing-sound:Appearing Sound]
