[Audio:amulet-piece-sound:Amulet Piece Sound]
Played by #R$BF3D.
Eight cycles of a tone. This is an example, as the pitch depends on how far
the player is from the nearest amulet piece.

#AUDIO0(amulet-piece-sound.wav)(#INCLUDE(AmuletPieceSound))

